Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Xiao-Jin He work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 7, "end": 180, "text": "Sophia Patel made her way through the bustling corridors of University Medical Center Groningen, she couldn't help but notice the eclectic mix of artwork adorning the walls."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 181, "end": 343, "text": "A vibrant abstract piece by a local artist caught her eye, and she paused for a moment to appreciate the splash of color amidst the sterile hospital surroundings."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 344, "end": 450, "text": "Her thoughts were interrupted by the soft chime of the elevator, signaling its arrival on the fifth floor."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 451, "end": 613, "text": "She stepped inside, joining a handful of other medical professionals, including a bespectacled researcher with a kind face and a name tag that read \"Xiao-Jin He.\""}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 614, "end": 731, "text": "Sophia exchanged a brief smile with Xiao-Jin, recognizing the quiet intensity that often accompanied brilliant minds."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 732, "end": 883, "text": "She had heard whispers about his groundbreaking work in the field of regenerative medicine, and she wondered what project had brought him to Groningen."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 884, "end": 1016, "text": "As the elevator doors opened on the seventh floor, Xiao-Jin nodded in her direction before disappearing into the sea of white coats."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1017, "end": 1147, "text": "Later that afternoon, Sophia found herself in the hospital's cafeteria, sipping a lukewarm coffee and scrolling through her phone."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1148, "end": 1272, "text": "Her eyes landed on a news article about a recent breakthrough in stem cell research, and her mind wandered back to Xiao-Jin."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1273, "end": 1394, "text": "She recalled a snippet of conversation she had overheard earlier, something about a novel approach to tissue engineering."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1395, "end": 1496, "text": "It wasn't until she stumbled upon a photo of Xiao-Jin standing alongside the hospital's director, Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1497, "end": 1552, "text": "Van der Meer, that the pieces began to fall into place."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1553, "end": 1741, "text": "The caption mentioned a collaborative project between the University Medical Center Groningen and a prominent research institution in Beijing, with Xiao-Jin serving as the lead researcher."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1742, "end": 1940, "text": "As Sophia finished her coffee, she felt a sense of pride knowing that her hospital was at the forefront of medical innovation, thanks in part to the tireless efforts of researchers like Xiao-Jin He."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 82, "text": "Title: The Unwavering Dedication of Xiao-Jin He: A Testament to Medical Excellence"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 84, "end": 226, "text": "In the bustling city of Hefei, China, a beacon of hope shines bright in the form of the First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 227, "end": 370, "text": "This esteemed institution has been at the forefront of medical innovation, providing top-notch care to the people of Anhui Province and beyond."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 371, "end": 512, "text": "Among the hospital's esteemed researchers, one name stands out for their unwavering dedication and groundbreaking contributions: Xiao-Jin He."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 513, "end": 779, "text": "As we delve into the remarkable story of Xiao-Jin He, it becomes evident that their association with the First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University is more than just a mere affiliation – it's a testament to their unrelenting pursuit of medical excellence."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 780, "end": 857, "text": "The year was 2005 when Xiao-Jin He first joined the hospital's research team."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 858, "end": 1003, "text": "Fresh from completing their postdoctoral studies, He brought with them a wealth of knowledge and a burning passion for advancing medical science."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1004, "end": 1199, "text": "Their initial research focus was on the molecular mechanisms underlying cardiovascular diseases, an area of great concern in China, where cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of mortality."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1200, "end": 1386, "text": "He's early work at the hospital was marked by a series of publications in reputable scientific journals, including the Journal of Cardiovascular Medicine and the Chinese Medical Journal."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1387, "end": 1547, "text": "These papers not only showcased He's expertise in molecular biology but also demonstrated their ability to collaborate with colleagues from diverse disciplines."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1548, "end": 1648, "text": "One such publication, \"The Role of MicroRNAs in Cardiovascular Disease\" (2007), co-authored with Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1649, "end": 1801, "text": "Liang Chen, a renowned cardiologist at the hospital, highlighted the potential of microRNAs as therapeutic targets for cardiovascular disease treatment."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1802, "end": 1959, "text": "As He's research career progressed, they began to explore the realm of cancer biology, particularly the molecular mechanisms driving lung cancer progression."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1960, "end": 2106, "text": "This shift in focus was largely influenced by the alarming rise in lung cancer incidence in China, which had become a major public health concern."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2107, "end": 2241, "text": "He's work in this area led to several breakthroughs, including the identification of novel biomarkers for early lung cancer detection."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2242, "end": 2396, "text": "One of He's most significant contributions during this period was the development of a novel diagnostic assay for lung cancer, which was patented in 2012."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2397, "end": 2531, "text": "This innovation was the result of a collaborative effort between He's research team and the hospital's Department of Thoracic Surgery."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2532, "end": 2684, "text": "The assay's high sensitivity and specificity made it an attractive tool for clinicians, and it has since been adopted by several hospitals across China."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Xiao-Jin He", "scope": "Employer/Institution", "claim": "Xiao-Jin He served as the lead researcher in a collaborative project between the University Medical Center Groningen and a prominent research institution in Beijing.", "answer": "University Medical Center Groningen", "quote": "The caption mentioned a collaborative project between the University Medical Center Groningen and a prominent research institution in Beijing, with Xiao-Jin serving as the lead researcher.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Xiao-Jin He", "scope": "Employer/Institution", "claim": "Xiao-Jin He served as the lead researcher in a collaborative project between the University Medical Center Groningen and a prominent research institution in Beijing.", "answer": "prominent research institution in Beijing", "quote": "The caption mentioned a collaborative project between the University Medical Center Groningen and a prominent research institution in Beijing, with Xiao-Jin serving as the lead researcher.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Xiao-Jin He", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Xiao-Jin He joined the research team of the First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University in 2005.", "answer": "First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University", "quote": "In the bustling city of Hefei, China, a beacon of hope shines bright in the form of the First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University. This esteemed institution has been at the forefront of medical innovation, providing top-notch care to the people of Anhui Province and beyond. Among the hospital's esteemed researchers, one name stands out for their unwavering dedication and groundbreaking contributions: Xiao-Jin He. As we delve into the remarkable story of Xiao-Jin He, it becomes evident that their association with the First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University is more than just a mere affiliation – it's a testament to their unrelenting pursuit of medical excellence. The year was 2005 when Xiao-Jin He first joined the hospital's research team.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["University Medical Center Groningen", "prominent research institution in Beijing", "First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "University Medical Center Groningen", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "prominent research institution in Beijing", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "First Affiliated Hospital of Anhui Medical University", "origin": "initial"}]}

